{"3323890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bearly Alive", "steam_appid": 3323890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bearly Alive</strong> – Defend. Shoot. Avenge.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <strong>Bearly Alive</strong>, food is infinite... but at what cost? You play as a gummy bear returning from the grave, determined to avenge your people after being sacrificed to the God of Food. Once a respected community, the gummy bears lost everything—now, it's time to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>intense mix of Tower Defense and Third-Person Shooter</strong> challenges you to build strategic defenses while diving into action-packed combat against relentless waves of enemies who want to invade your castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◑ ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ ▣ ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ ◐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔸 <strong>Tower Defense + TPS</strong> – Set up traps and turrets, but also take matters into your own hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔸 <strong>Relentless enemy hordes</strong> – Face increasingly challenging waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔸 <strong>The revenge of a sweet warrior</strong> – Uncover the dark truth behind a world that thrives on gummy bear suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔸 <strong>An eldritch arsenal</strong> – Wield unique weapons and special abilities to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◑ ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ ▣ ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ ◐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the gummy bears is in your hands. Will you break the cycle and restore your people's honor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>The feast is over. Now it’s time for revenge!</strong> 🔥</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bearly Alive</strong> – Defend. Shoot. Avenge.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <strong>Bearly Alive</strong>, food is infinite... but at what cost? You play as a gummy bear returning from the grave, determined to avenge your people after being sacrificed to the God of Food. Once a respected community, the gummy bears lost everything—now, it's time to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>intense mix of Tower Defense and Third-Person Shooter</strong> challenges you to build strategic defenses while diving into action-packed combat against relentless waves of enemies who want to invade your castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◑ ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ ▣ ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ ◐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔸 <strong>Tower Defense + TPS</strong> – Set up traps and turrets, but also take matters into your own hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔸 <strong>Relentless enemy hordes</strong> – Face increasingly challenging waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔸 <strong>The revenge of a sweet warrior</strong> – Uncover the dark truth behind a world that thrives on gummy bear suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔸 <strong>An eldritch arsenal</strong> – Wield unique weapons and special abilities to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◑ ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ ▣ ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ ◐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the gummy bears is in your hands. Will you break the cycle and restore your people's honor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>The feast is over. Now it’s time for revenge!</strong> 🔥</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dash, Shoot and run. Those monsters want to steal your candy. Build and fight for the good of bearkind in this Tower Defense and 3rd Person Action hybrid!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323890/header.jpg?t=1746007090", "capsule